Setting",[157,161,162],{},"What it does",[164,165,166,175,183],"tbody",{},[154,167,168,172],{},[169,170,171],"td",{},"Language",[169,173,174],{},"14 languages; the app follows the system language until you pick one.",[154,176,177,180],{},[169,178,179],{},"Auto-connect",[169,181,182],{},"Put every SIM on sale as soon as it is read. Saved in your account, shared by your gateways.",[154,184,185,188],{},[169,186,187],{},"Low-power mode",[169,189,190,191,195],{},"Fewer animations, shorter logs. ",[192,193,194],"code",{},"auto"," turns it on for computers with 1–2 CPU cores.",[143,197,199],{"id":198},"connection-and-logs","Connection and logs",[148,201,202,210],{},[151,203,204],{},[154,205,206,208],{},[157,207,159],{},[157,209,162],{},[164,211,212,227,235],{},[154,213,214,217],{},[169,215,216],{},"Log level",[169,218,219,222,223,226],{},[192,220,221],{},"info"," by default; ",[192,224,225],{},"debug"," for support requests.",[154,228,229,232],{},[169,230,231],{},"Connections",[169,233,234],{},"How many ports may list numbers at the same time (1–200). Lower it on weak hardware.",[154,236,237,240],{},[169,238,239],{},"Port name in list",[169,241,242],{},"Device path, port id or your own name.",[143,244,246],{"id":245},"modem-and-encoding","Modem and encoding",[148,248,249,257],{},[151,250,251],{},[154,252,253,255],{},[157,254,159],{},[157,256,162],{},[164,258,259,267,277],{},[154,260,261,264],{},[169,262,263],{},"Known modems only",[169,265,266],{},"Refuse modems that match no built-in profile.",[154,268,269,272],{},[169,270,271],{},"PDU \u002F USSD encoding",[169,273,274,276],{},[192,275,194],{}," fits nearly every modem; force one only when an operator needs it.",[154,278,279,282],{},[169,280,281],{},"Mode switching",[169,283,284],{},"Network mode for modems that lose registration in some modes.",[143,286,288],{"id":287},"web-ui-bridge","Web UI bridge",[134,290,291,292,295],{},"Turns on the browser UI of the desktop app: port, path, login and password. The headless gateway\nalways serves it. See ",[293,294,68],"a",{"href":69},".",[143,297,299],{"id":298},"scheduled-maintenance","Scheduled maintenance",[134,301,302],{},"Restart modems or change the IMEI every N hours (0 = off).",[143,304,306],{"id":305},"numbers-and-imsi","Numbers and IMSI",[134,308,309],{},"Replacement rules for IMSI prefixes, extra noise patterns for numbers in USSD answers, and how the\nnumber is read from the SIM (phone book slot, write back to the SIM, wait for an SMS).",{"title":311,"searchDepth":312,"depth":312,"links":313},"",2,[314,315,316,317,318,319],{"id":145,"depth":312,"text":146},{"id":198,"depth":312,"text":199},{"id":245,"depth":312,"text":246},{"id":287,"depth":312,"text":288},{"id":298,"depth":312,"text":299},{"id":305,"depth":312,"text":306},"The settings that matter day to day, grouped as in the app.","md",null,{},{"icon":39},{"title":36,"description":320},"3zfRQvfbG2-Mghnl9roIkh4UKjxiSPA56o4rsl20w6M",[328,330],{"title":31,"path":32,"description":329},"The SMS inbox of a port, USSD requests, and teaching the gateway an operator's own-number and balance codes.",{"title":41,"path":42,"description":331},"Income, withdrawals and the sales statistics of your account.",1794978314519]